      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ǐ<U+0000> 말이지.\n기다리고 있어!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 2112,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201CF00000020B9D0C774C9C0002E000AAE30B2E4B9ACACE00020C788C5B400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "자, 불꽃세례 로스트!\n살짝 태운 원두의 맛을 느껴 보라고.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 2152,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C790002C0020BD88AF43C138B8400020B85CC2A4D2B80021000AC0B4C9DD0020D0DCC6B40020C6D0B450C7580020B9DBC7440020B290AEF40020BCF4B77CACE0002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "자, 화염방사 로스트!\n신맛, 쓴맛, 단맛을 모두 느껴 보라고.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 2220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C790002C0020D654C5FCBC29C0AC0020B85CC2A4D2B80021000AC2E0B9DB002C0020C4F4B9DB002C0020B2E8B9DBC7440020BAA8B4500020B290AEF40020BCF4B77CACE0002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "자, 불대문자 로스트!\n신맛보다는 구수함과 쓴맛이 강할 거야.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 2292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C790002C0020BD88B300BB38C7900020B85CC2A4D2B80021000AC2E0B9DBBCF4B2E4B2940020AD6CC218D568ACFC0020C4F4B9DBC7740020AC15D5600020AC70C57C002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "자, 불사르기 로스트!\n오래 로스팅해서 강한 쓴맛을 즐길 수 있어.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 2364,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C790002C0020BD88C0ACB974AE300020B85CC2A4D2B80021000AC624B7980020B85CC2A4D305D574C11C0020AC15D55C0020C4F4B9DBC7440020C990AE380020C2180020C788C5B4002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "자, 핫삼티!\n달콤한 향에 깊은 풍미, 강철의 맛을 느껴 봐!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 2440,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C790002C0020D56BC0BCD2F00021000AB2ECCF64D55C0020D5A5C5D00020AE4AC7400020D48DBBF8002C0020AC15CCA0C7580020B9DBC7440020B290AEF40020BD1000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "자, 샤로다즐링티!\n산뜻하면서도 고상한 맛이 느껴질 거야.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 2512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C790002C0020C0E4B85CB2E4C990B9C1D2F00021000AC0B0B73BD558BA74C11CB3C40020ACE0C0C1D55C0020B9DBC7740020B290AEF4C9C80020AC70C57C002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "자, 로즈레이티!\n순하고 좋은 향이 나서 알로라에서도 인기야.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 2580,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C790002C0020B85CC988B808C774D2F00021000AC21CD558ACE00020C88BC7400020D5A5C7740020B098C11C0020C54CB85CB77CC5D0C11CB3C40020C778AE30C57C002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "자, 튼튼밀크!\n영양 만점인 우유라고.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 2652,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C790002C0020D2BCD2BCBC00D06C0021000AC601C5910020B9CCC810C7780020C6B0C720B77CACE0002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "자, 맛있는물!\n다른 지방의 것보다 마그네슘이 많다나 봐.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 2696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C790002C0020B9DBC788B294BB3C0021000AB2E4B9780020C9C0BC29C7580020AC83BCF4B2E40020B9C8ADF8B124C298C7740020B9CEB2E4B0980020BD10002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "자, 톡쏘는물!\n평범한 물이랑은 살짝 느낌이 다를 거야.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 49,
